IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0025.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0025C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 A-DC               PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-SCORE-DECISION
    DISPLAY "A-DC=" A-DC
    STOP RUN.
2000-SCORE-DECISION.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF B-SC >= 576
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF B-SC >= 720
       AND D-IR < 0.35
        MOVE 'A' TO A-DC
    ELSE
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        IF B-SC >= 640
            MOVE 'R' TO A-DC
        ELSE
            MOVE 'D' TO A-DC
        END-IF
    END-IF.
